If pShowToast
	Do $cinst.$$showToast(ivCurrentWorkTitle,pick(isclear(pCustomToastMessage),pCustomToastMessage,con(ivCurrentWorkDescription,pick(pIsOk," failed. Check the trace log for details."," succeeded."))),pick(pCustomToastType>=0,pick(pIsOk,kToastError,kToastSuccess),pCustomToastType))
End If

Calculate ivCurrentWorkTitle as ""
Calculate ivCurrentWorkDescription as ""
Calculate ivSuppressAutoRegistration as kFalse

Quit method pIsOk